@membershipUrl = http://localhost:3002
@accessUrl = http://localhost:3003
@sedeId = 11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111

### 1. Crear un miembro (en Membership)
# @name miembro
POST {{membershipUrl}}/members
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ana Pérez", "email": "ana-prod2@example.com" }

### 2. Crear un plan (en Membership)
# @name plan
POST {{membershipUrl}}/plans
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Plan Prod", "price": 600000, "resourceAccess": ["DESK", "ROOM"] }

### 3. Suscribir al miembro (en Membership)
# @name suscripcion
POST {{membershipUrl}}/subscriptions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "memberId": "{{miembro.response.body.id}}", "planId": "{{plan.response.body.id}}" }

### 4. Pedir la credencial QR (Access Control consulta a Membership)
# @name credencial
POST {{accessUrl}}/credentials
Content-Type: application/json

{ "memberId": "{{miembro.response.body.id}}" }

### 5. Validar en la puerta: debe dar granted true
POST {{accessUrl}}/access/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{ "token": "{{credencial.response.body.token}}", "locationId": "{{sedeId}}" }

### 6. Cancelar la suscripción (Membership publica membership.expired)
PATCH {{membershipUrl}}/subscriptions/{{suscripcion.response.body.id}}/cancel

### 7. Validar otra vez: debe dar granted false, CREDENTIAL_REVOKED
POST {{accessUrl}}/access/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{ "token": "{{credencial.response.body.token}}", "locationId": "{{sedeId}}" }

### 8. Pedir una credencial nueva: debe fallar con 403 (ya no tiene membresía)
POST {{accessUrl}}/credentials
Content-Type: application/json

{ "memberId": "{{miembro.response.body.id}}" }

### 9. Ver el historial de accesos
GET {{accessUrl}}/access/logs?memberId={{miembro.response.body.id}}